- https://aminet.net/package/docs/hard/ps2m
- https://aminet.net/package/util/mouse/WheelBusMouse
Adapted for Vampire V4 by RedBug.
    
    
How to use ApolloWheel?
Open a shell, change to the corresponding drawer and type:

ApolloWheel <RETURN>


Different options are available:

ApolloWheel REVERSE            Reverse the (vertical) scrolling direction.
ApolloWheel DELAY=x            Waiting time before reading scrolling register again.
ApolloWheel MULTIPLY=x         Faster scrolling (vertical delta is multiplied by x).
ApolloWheel PRIORITY=x         Run ApolloWheel with this priority.
ApolloWheel QUIET              No output (ApolloWheel notifies you if it is already running).
ApolloWheel LIMIT=x            If vertical scrolling exceeds this value, the counter is 
                               set to 0 (prevent excessive scrolling when mouse is plugged in).

All options can be written in UPPER or lower case (no difference).
The options can be given in any order.


To stop ApolloWheel:

Open SCOUT, search for ApolloWheelUSB and send a BREAK signal.


